value.VISUAL_STYLE.0=Default
value.VISUAL_STYLE.1=§7DARK FA§fNTASY§r
option.DARK_STYLE_STRENGTH=Dark Fantasy strength
option.DARK_STYLE_STRENGTH.comment=Grim palette: muted daylight, cold blue shadows, subdued skies and rusty sunsets. Lower strength for a gentler treatment.
option.DARK_HAZE=Dark Fantasy distance haze
option.DARK_HAZE.comment=Outdoor distance haze, reduced in caves and strengthened during rain. Not volumetric fog.
option.DARK_LIGHT_TINT=Dark Fantasy light color
option.DARK_LIGHT_TINT.comment=Original lighting only: separates cool shade, warm sunlight and block light. Independent lighting uses its own palette. Sky, fog and grading are controlled separately.

screen.DIAGNOSTICS=Diagnostics
profile.comment=Select a quality tier, then tune its controls in Performance. Changing a performance setting shows Custom. Art style stays independent. Air and Pro have one cloud layer and no reflections, AO or sunbeams. FPS gaps are approximate targets.
option.VISUAL_STYLE.comment=Choose Default, Dark Fantasy or Miyazaki independently of performance.

value.VISUAL_STYLE.2=§7MIYAZAK§fI§r
option.CARTOON_STRENGTH=Miyazaki strength
option.CARTOON_STRENGTH.comment=Storybook palette: turquoise sky, ivory daylight, cool teal shade, pale gold sunset and blue nights. Preserves texture detail. Only affects Miyazaki.

value.SHADOW_FILTER.2=Soft tent (nine samples)
option.SHADOW_FILTER.comment=HIGH impact across lit surfaces: 1, 4 or 9 shadow comparisons. Lower this before reducing resolution if softer edges are less important.

