option.MAX_AO.comment=MEDIUM impact. Adds contact/corner shading to nearby terrain; Off skips this effect. Air and Pro disable it.
option.MAX_SUNBEAMS.comment=HIGH impact in outdoor scenes. Samples shadow visibility along view rays. Air and Pro disable it.

option.MAX_LIGHTING=Independent lighting
value.MAX_LIGHTING.0=Original
value.MAX_LIGHTING.1=Sun / sky / block light
option.MAX_LIGHTING.comment=LOW to MEDIUM impact. Separates sky, sun and local lighting with highlight compression. Air and Pro use the simpler lighting path.

