option.CLOUD_STYLE=Cloud style
value.CLOUD_STYLE.0=Vanilla
value.CLOUD_STYLE.1=SDV Skybox
value.CLOUD_STYLE.2=Fading Clouds
option.CLOUD_STYLE.comment=SDV Skybox uses the adapted reference renderer and cloud map with Metal preset tones and terrain-independent reach. Fading Clouds and Vanilla remain available.
option.CLOUD_OPACITY=Custom cloud opacity
option.CLOUD_OPACITY.comment=Opacity of custom clouds. Does not affect Vanilla clouds.

screen.CELESTIAL_SETTINGS=Sun and Moon
option.CUBIC_CELESTIALS=Sun and moon style
value.CUBIC_CELESTIALS.0=Game / Resource Pack
value.CUBIC_CELESTIALS.1=Cubic
option.CUBIC_CELESTIALS.comment=LOW impact. Uses custom sun/moon sprites and eight moon phases. Air uses the game celestial textures.

screen.WATER_SETTINGS=Water
option.MAKEUP_WATER=Water style
value.MAKEUP_WATER.0=Game / Resource Pack
value.MAKEUP_WATER.1=MakeUp Adaptation
option.MAKEUP_WATER.comment=MEDIUM to HIGH combined cost. Custom waves and depth-based water add sampling and a scene snapshot. Reflections are the largest optional addition.

option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH=Water wave strength
option.WATER_WAVE_STRENGTH.comment=Controls procedural wave normals, without moving the water geometry.
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Water reflections
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=HIGH impact around water. Sky + Scene traces terrain reflections; Sky avoids that trace. Off disables reflections.

screen.WET_GROUND_SETTINGS=Puddles and Wet Ground
option.RAIN_PUDDLES=Rain puddles
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.0=Off
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.1=On
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment=LOW to MEDIUM impact on rainy ground without reflections. Adds puddle coverage and wet darkening. Sky + Scene wet reflections add a separate high cost.
option.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS=Wet ground reflections
value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.0=Off
value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.1=Sky (Fast)
value.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.2=Sky + Scene (Experimental)
option.WET_GROUND_REFLECTIONS.comment=HIGH impact in rain when wet ground covers the screen. Sky + Scene traces terrain; Sky is cheaper. Off keeps wet darkening without reflections.

screen.WEATHER_SETTINGS=Weather
option.UNOBTRUSIVE_WEATHER=Unobtrusive weather
option.UNOBTRUSIVE_WEATHER.comment=LOW impact. Replaces rain and snow texture sampling; does not add particle simulation. Air uses game weather.
option.RAIN_RIPPLES=Rain ripples
option.RAIN_RIPPLES.comment=LOW to MEDIUM impact on rainy water. Requires custom water with refraction or reflections. Off removes the rain-ring calculations.
option.RAIN_RIPPLE_STRENGTH=Rain ripple strength


option.WATER_REFRACTION=Water refraction
option.WATER_ABSORPTION=Water absorption
option.WATER_ABSORPTION.comment=Higher values make deep water more opaque.
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.0=Off
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.1=Sky
value.WATER_REFLECTIONS.2=Sky + Scene

option.SDV_CLOUD_STEPS=Skybox cloud depth quality
option.SDV_CLOUD_STEPS.comment=MEDIUM to HIGH impact when much of the sky is visible. More steps improve cloud thickness. One layer costs less than two.

option.FOLIAGE_WIND=Foliage wind
option.FOLIAGE_WIND.comment=LOW impact. Vertex-only sway with matching shadows, fading out by 48 blocks. No extra wind textures or screen effects. Off removes animation work.
option.FOLIAGE_WIND_STRENGTH=Wind strength

profile.ULTRA=Pro Max Plus
option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=Off skips the shadow pass and receiving comparisons. Sunbeams also require shadows.
option.MAX_AO_QUALITY=AO quality
value.MAX_AO_QUALITY.1=4 samples
value.MAX_AO_QUALITY.2=8 samples
option.SUNBEAM_STEPS=Sunbeam quality
option.SDV_CLOUD_LAYERS=Cloud layers
option.WATER_SSR_STEPS=Water scene reflection quality
option.WATER_SSR_STEPS.comment=HIGH impact only with Sky + Scene water reflections. More samples improve scene tracing but cost more per water pixel.

option.shadowMapResolution.comment=HIGH impact while shadows are enabled. Higher resolution makes finer shadows but uses more graphics memory and shadow rendering work.

option.shadowDistance.comment=HIGH impact while shadows are enabled. Longer range draws more terrain and foliage into the shadow map.

option.SDV_CLOUD_LAYERS.comment=MEDIUM to HIGH impact in open skies. Two layers run the cloud sampling twice. Air and Pro use one.

option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=MEDIUM impact over water. Distorts the scene beneath water and uses the scene snapshot. Turn off for simpler water.

option.MAX_AO_QUALITY.comment=MEDIUM impact while AO is on. Eight samples shade more directions than four at greater cost.

option.SUNBEAM_STEPS.comment=HIGH impact while sunbeams are on. More samples smooth the rays but increase sampling work.

screen.PERF_SHADOWS=Shadows (High impact)
screen.PERF_CLOUDS=Clouds (Medium-High)
screen.PERF_WATER=Water (High impact)
screen.PERF_EFFECTS=Lighting effects (High)
screen.PERF_FOLIAGE=Foliage (Low impact)

screen.PERF_ANTIALIASING=Edge smoothing (Medium)
screen.COLOR_GRADING=Color grading
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS=Entity shadows
option.ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment=Shadows from mobs and players. Disabling can reduce shadow rendering work in busy areas. Requires Shadows.
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS=Block entity shadows
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment=Shadows from rendered block entities such as chests. Disabling can reduce shadow rendering work. Requires Shadows.
option.FXAA=Fast edge smoothing
option.FXAA.comment=MEDIUM impact: spatial smoothing without history buffers. Reduces jagged edges but can soften texture detail. Does not eliminate temporal foliage shimmer.
option.GRADE_BRIGHTNESS=Brightness
option.GRADE_CONTRAST=Contrast
option.GRADE_SATURATION=Saturation
option.GRADE_GREEN_SATURATION=Green saturation
option.GRADE_GREEN_SATURATION.comment=Adjusts green-dominant colors in the final image, including green sky or objects. Does not identify materials.
